    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Weapon (Any Melee Weapon with the Finesse Property), Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This thin, black, iron blade is popular among Thayan assassins and spies.</p><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. When you hit with an attack roll using this weapon, the target takes an extra 2d4 Necrotic damage, and it can’t regain Hit Points until the end of its next turn. If a creature is reduced to 0 Hit Points by an attack using this weapon, the creature immediately dies and can be restored to life only by a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplResurrecti]{Resurrection} or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTrueResurr]{True Resurrection} spell.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ZZ9gNOGG94Ikf0hG\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Glissez l’enchantement sur l’arme voulue : elle garde son nom, sa rareté et son prix. Elle reçoit le bonus de +1 et les 2d4 Necrotic sur ses attaques. Après un coup, appliquez <em>Life Sapped</em> depuis <em>Life Sap</em>. La mort à 0 point de vie est à appliquer à la main.</p></section><p>@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p>",
